OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 6, who died in van crash was
OL,4,A'loved more deeply than words could
OL,5,Aever express'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA six-year-old boy who died when he was
OL,8,Fstruck by a van outside of his home has
OL,9,Fbeen named as Harrison Glynne Jones.
OL,11,FIn a tribute on a fund-raising page
OL,12,Flaunched to support his family, he was
OL,13,Fdescribed as a "cheeky chappy, full of
OL,14,Fcharacter with a personality that could
OL,15,Flight up a room", and who had been
OL,16,F"loved more deeply than words could
OL,17,Fever express".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
