OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 6, who died in van crash was
OL,4,A'loved more deeply than words could
OL,5,Aever express'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficers were called to reports of an
OL,8,Fincident involving a white Ford Transit
OL,9,FTipper and a child on Mill Road in
OL,10,FLlanfairfechan, Conwy county, after
OL,11,F17:00 BST on Thursday, where Harrison
OL,12,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,14,FNorth Wales Police said a 39-year-old
OL,15,Fman had been arrested and later
OL,16,Freleased under investigation.
